{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed first floor rear extensions, by reason of their inappropriate size, scale and positioning, would result in a bulky and incongruous addition, and fail to reflect to the proportions of the main house. The proposed development would therefore harm the character and appearance of the host property and wider area, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), CC4 (Heritage) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
